--Sunder</i>
<p>~EIn the times when Islands only begin 
floating in the skies on one of those
islands lived the priest named Sunder
He was very rich. But after a long
time he became the poor and his 
neighbors became worse...
$Button=Proceed,Tell,SH3_1

[SH3_1]
<h2>~lCoward neighbors</h2>
<i>"Never sleep if you dont trust to your 
neighbors!"<br>
--Sunder, 1234 F.K.</i>
<p>In one time Sunder decided to replace his temple 
and sold it. After this long work he went to sleep. 
During his sleep, his evil thunder neighbors allied and 
begin to kill him. Sunder suddenly wake up. Now he 
must survive! He is poor and don't have too many tech.
Welcome to the first war of Nimbus!

